descriptive/analysis_v2.0/M12_pathway_v2.1/M12_01_mapping.R,M12,Script,ACTIVE_FINAL,Yes (entry 1),Yes,Yes,KEEP_ACTIVE,Deterministic PG.ProteinGroups -> gene mapping contract on the 1434-protein tested universe. Produces mapping/M12_gene_mapping_contract.csv + summary.
descriptive/analysis_v2.0/M12_pathway_v2.1/M12_02_ranked_ora.R,M12,Script,ACTIVE_FINAL,Yes (entry 2),Yes,Yes,KEEP_ACTIVE,Primary cameraPR (cor=0.01 primary, 0.05 sensitivity) + ORA Fisher-exact on 85 DEPs. GO BP + Reactome; KEGG attempted via clusterProfiler::download_KEGG and recorded as NOT_RUN when incomplete.
descriptive/analysis_v2.0/M12_pathway_v2.1/M12_02b_kegg_fix.R,M12,Script,ACTIVE_FINAL,Yes (entry 2b),Yes,Yes,KEEP_ACTIVE,Supplemental KEGG attempt that overwrites ranked/ORA combined FDRs after re-deriving KEGG sets. Final output for KEGG is the NOT_RUN placeholder; this script records the failed-resource provenance. Part of the deterministic execution chain.
descriptive/analysis_v2.0/M12_pathway_v2.1/M12_03_integration.R,M12,Script,ACTIVE_FINAL,Yes (entry 3),Yes,Yes,KEEP_ACTIVE,Core-gene extraction (top-quartile |t|, explicitly NOT GSEA leading-edge), environment-stratified cameraPR (Humid-hot / High-pressure-high-altitude), ML-candidate pathway membership, Reactome redundancy clustering, run manifest + DB versions.
descriptive/analysis_v2.0/M12_pathway_v2.1/README_METHODS.md,M12,Doc,REPRODUCIBILITY_REQUIRED,No (documentation),Yes,Yes,KEEP_ACTIVE,Methods/provenance doc: scope, mapping contract, databases, methods, outputs, fgsea sensitivity, interpretation boundaries.
descriptive/analysis_v2.0/M12_pathway_v2.1/00_probe.R,M12,Script,DEBUG_ONLY,No,No,No,DO_NOT_TRACK,One-off environment probe with HARD-CODED F:/env absolute paths. Not sourced; writes probe.log. Superseded by M12_run_manifest.csv.
descriptive/analysis_v2.0/M12_pathway_v2.1/probe2.R,M12,Script,DEBUG_ONLY,No,No,No,DO_NOT_TRACK,One-off GO BP / reactome.db probe. Not sourced; no output artifact.
descriptive/analysis_v2.0/M12_pathway_v2.1/probe3.R,M12,Script,DEBUG_ONLY,No,No,No,DO_NOT_TRACK,One-off package availability probe. Not sourced; no output.
descriptive/analysis_v2.0/M12_pathway_v2.1/check_anchors_fgsea.R,M12,Script,DEBUG_ONLY,No (reads leading_edge only),No,No,DO_NOT_TRACK,Read-only diagnostic that prints Anchor-5 rows from fgsea leading edge. Not part of execution chain; content already summarized in README.
descriptive/analysis_v2.0/M12_pathway_v2.1/install_msigdbdf.R,M12,Script,INSTALL_HELPER,No,No,No,DO_NOT_TRACK,One-off install.packages("msigdbdf") from r-universe. The active pipeline explicitly avoids msigdbr/msigdbdf (uses local org.Hs.eg.db / reactome.db). Not a runtime dependency.
